graphicScale=58;sun.light?.shadowRadius=i==0 ? 3:2\\n108:            sun.light?.shadowSampleCount=8;sun.light?.shadowColor=NSColor.black\\n109:            sun.light?.shadowBias=0.6;root.addChildNode(sun)\\n123:            let texel=116/Double(sun.light!.shadowMapSize.width)\\nBuilding Marvin Simulator (release)\\nBuilding for production...\\n[0/3] Write sources\\n[1/3] Write swift-version--1AB21518FC5DEDBE.txt\\n\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"5ddc73\",\"wall_time_seconds\":4.680856875,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_08092949d98b672f016ac0f9a664e487d2b4163b338156fa24","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"The second viewpoint also had no whole architecture cell that could be removed without changing pixels. I’m checking the rest of the scene’s geometry now—track, residents, robots, and effects—so the next optimization targets the largest source of work rather than assuming buildings dominate.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_08092949d98b672f016ac0f9a77b4c87d28b1bcd7e1940345d","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_SDy1DmpG5EVv6e6mmqXzAhwQ","id":"ctc_08092949d98b672f016ac0f9aa0d4887d2b35892176ee83094","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"MARVIN_BENCHMARK_SECONDS=15 MARVIN_DAYLIGHT_FRACTION=0.5 MARVIN_SANDSTORM=0 MARVIN_GPU_VARIANTS='' 'apps/simulator-macos/.build/Marvin Simulator.app/Contents/MacOS/MarvinSimulator' --town-benchmark /Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix/visibility-town-inventory-final --city-roam --benchmark-visibility-audit --benchmark-gpu-probe \u003e /Users/thomi/Projects/marvin-town-planning/sustained-fix/visibility-town-inventory-final.log 2\u003e\u00261\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/thomi/Projects/entireio-marvin\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791031715.995247,"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_SDy1DmpG5EVv6e6mmqXzAhwQ","id":"ctco_01a101cf-612e-7612-9283-7df1192131ad","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791031730.478755,"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.2 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"153192\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.0025365,\"session_id\":7172,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"author":"/root/astra_ultra_final_judge","content":[{"text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/astra_ultra_final_judge\nPayload:\nNo remaining blocking measurement issue in the updated source.\n\nThe deferred restoration, exact-control validity, positive control, pixel-layout guards and warmed frustum queries address the identified defects.\n\nOne useful consistency check for the fresh report: compare the **Town-cell frustum sets** in `geometryInventory` and `cells`. The current nonempty check could pass because another object is visible even if the inventory’s Town-cell queries failed.\n\nZero removable cells supports only “no whole-cell removal opportunity found in these frozen views.” It establishes neither GPU submission counts nor potential savings elsewhere. I have not executed the updated build.","type":"input_text"}],"id":"amsg_01a101cf-6131-7320-99ca-7c5839fd9366","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791031730.481475,"turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2"},"recipient":"/root","type":"agent_message"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_08092949d98b672f016ac