{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T12:55:02.277Z","ordinal":17187,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","turn_id":"01a101c3-e32d-7580-ba72-be0d3d17ace2","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_08092949d98b672f016ac0fb22efa087d2b6e181dc91b80902","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The new inventory changes the priority: Marvin’s CAD model contains roughly **992,000 triangles across 253 geometry nodes** in this camera view, versus about **109,000** in the town architecture. That is mesh inventory, not a measured GPU submission count, but it makes Marvin’s internal parts and repeated processing a stronger first target than blindly reducing buildings.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791032099112,"completed_at_ms":1791032102277}}
